    "chunk_text": "\ufffd\u00e6t reaf ne arist na \u00f0e hra\u00f0or mid \u00feam men, for God asent \u00feonne his englas, and hi gegaderia\u00f0 him to ealle his gecorenan of eallum middanearde, and \u00deonne sitt se H\u00e6lend on his heofonlican \u00f0rymsetle, mihtig and wuldorful, and milde \u00feam godum, His twelf apostolas, \u00fee him folgodon on life, sitta\u00f0 \u00feonne eac on twelf domsettlum, and ealle \u00f0a \u00d0\u00e6r beo\u00f0 feower gefylcu on \u00feam micelan flocce: \u00fe\u00e6t forme gefylc bi\u00f0 \u00fee we her fores\u00e6don, \u00fee sitta\u00f0 \u00d0\u00e6t o\u00f0er werod bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ra woruldmanna \u00f0e on godum weorcum Gode \u00e6r gecwemdon, and mid \u00d0\u00e6t \u00feridde werod bi\u00f0 witodlice \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6ra Cristenra manna \u00f0e cu\u00f0on heora geleafan, ac hi gremedon \u00de\u00e6t feor\u00f0e gefylc bi\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6ra fulra h\u00e6\u00f0enra \u00fee nane cy\u00f0\u00f0e ne h\u00e6fdon to \u00feam heofonlican Gode, ne Ne m\u00e6g \u00feonne nan man nahwar beon behydd, ac ealle beo\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fee \u00e6fre cuce w\u00e6ron, and \u00fe\u00e6r beo\u00f0 \u00de\u00e6r beo\u00f0 ealle gelice, ge se hlaford ge se \u00f0eowa, se rica and se heana, on \u00feam rihtan dome, and \u00f0\u00e6r \u00d0onne cwe\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend of his halgan \u00f0rymsettle to \u00f0am godum Cristenum \u00f0e Godes willan Me hingrode so\u00f0lice, and ge me gereordodon. Eft \u00f0a \u00f0a me \u00feyrste, ge sealdon me drincan. Eac ic w\u00e6s cuma, and ge me underfengon. Ic w\u00e6s eac swilce nacod,",
